    "created_at": "2023-06-30T12:25:53Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-06-30T12:25:53Z",
    "body": "This is a limit that appears to be implemented in the regular expression engine. It doesn't seem specific to `input` elements. As such this would be TC39 territory I think. And if it's not defined there the test is probably invalid.\r\n\r\ncc @mathiasbynens @syg ",
