    "created_at": "2023-07-07T00:23:55Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-07-07T00:24:27Z",
    "body": "@Constellation do you think it would make sense to have the limit on regular expressions only for `<input pattern>`? (WebKit currently has it on regular expressions in general.) So you'd only prevent against a loop when there's no JavaScript involved.",
