    "created_at": "2023-09-05T18:36:34Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-09-05T18:36:34Z",
    "body": "I think it makes sense for RegExp engines to put a cap on recursion for both Scripts and HTML.  Otherwise, as we can see, it is easy to create a webpage that hangs.",
